# Requests always use same-origin /api. Vite proxies locally; Vercel rewrites in production.
# Remove VITE_API_URL from the frontend hosting project; stale values are ignored by the client.
# To use a different development API server, set API_PROXY_TARGET when starting Vite.
# Used locally by npm run configure:vercel BEFORE deployment; not a browser variable.
# BACKEND_ORIGIN=https://your-persistent-api-host.example
